onate faceshield may \nbe utilized when transitioning \nbetween tasks (i.e. cutting rail to \nspiking etc.) and/or for additional \nprotection.\nChemical Plugger Splash goggles Faceshield over splash \ngoggles\nRefer to SDS\nChipping, Cutting or \nCaulking Metal\nImpact goggles Faceshield over impact \ngoggles\nChop Saw Faceshield over safety \nglasses\nFaceshield over impact \ngoggles\nClimbing Poles Safety glasses\nCut-off Discs, Saws, or T ools \nwith Carbide Bits/Blades\nFaceshield over safety \nglasses\nFaceshield over impact \ngoggles\nCutting Rivets, Bolts Faceshield over safety \nglasses\nFaceshield over impact \ngoggles\nWhen working over your \nhead, wear impact goggles and \nfaceshield\nCutting Cotter Keys,  \nSplitting Nuts\nSafety glasses Faceshield over safety \nglasses\nNote: Faceshield refers to polycarbonate faceshield unless otherwise specified.",
